      "readme": "# PM-20: Integrated Change Control (CRB), Scope Freeze & Baselines\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 4: Execution, Controls, Risk & Change (RIBA 5)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 4-6`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `Baseline Governance`\n- **WBS Scope**: `All WBS`\n- **Governing Standards**: ISO 10007 Configuration Management, SteerCo DoA Tiers 0-3\n- **Focus Areas**: CRB / SteerCo, Change Impact Form, BAC / Float Lock, Scope Freeze Waivers, Baseline Revisions\n\n## Module Overview\nGovern Change Requests through technical/cost/schedule impact scoring before Change Control Board sign-off and baseline revision.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | ISO 10007 Configuration Management & Baseline Change Governance Guide | `PM20_Doc1_Standard_ISO_10007_Configuration_Management_Rev.004.docx` | ISO 10007 Baseline Control |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Change Control Board (CRB) Charter, Delegated Financial Authority & SLAs | `PM20_Doc2_Deliverable_Change_Control_Board_CRB_Charter_Rev.004.docx` | CRB Governance Charter |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Change Request (CR) Impact Assessment Form (Tech, Capex, P6, PUE) | `PM20_Doc3_Template_Change_Request_CR_Impact_Assessment_Rev.004.xlsx` | CR Impact Form |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Approved Change Log, Baseline Revision History & Design Freeze Tracker | `PM20_Doc4_Audit_Approved_Change_Log_Baseline_Rev.004.xlsx` | Stage 4/5 Scope Freeze |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Enforce strict separation between pending tenant wishes and approved baseline changes.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Clarify PM vs. Sponsor approval caps so minor field tweaks move without stalling.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Force holistic impact sign-off on load density, P6 float, and PUE before issuing VOs.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Trace every EUR moved from contingency and justify late tenant variation orders.\n",
