      "id": "PM-22",
      "title": "Quality Assurance (QA/QC), ITPs & NCR / RFI Discipline",
      "desc": "Enforce Inspection & Test Plans, hold/witness points, concrete/weld QA logs, submittals SLAs, and timely Non-Conformance closure.",
      "tags": [
        "QA/QC",
        "ITP",
        "NCR"
      ],
      "folder": "Phase_4_Execution_Controls_Risk_RIBA_5\\PM-22_QA_QC_ITPs_NCR_RFI_Discipline",
      "keyFacts": [
        "Standards: ISO 9001 CQP + Irish BCAR Assigned Certifier Inspection Plan",
        "ITP Controls: Hold Points (H - Mandatory stop) | Witness (W) | Review (R)",
        "Non-Conformance: NCR Cat A (Safety/Structural stop) | Cat B | Cat C",
        "Field Hygiene: RFI SLA <= 5 working days to prevent slab/MEP stoppage",
        "NDE Tests: CFA pile integrity (PIT), structural concrete cubes, weld radiography"
      ],
      "readme": "# PM-22: Quality Assurance (QA/QC), ITPs & NCR / RFI Discipline\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 4: Execution, Controls, Risk & Change (RIBA 5)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 5`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `Site Construction`\n- **WBS Scope**: `WBS 4.0-5.0`\n- **Governing Standards**: ISO 9001 QA/QC, BCAR Inspection Plan, Trade ITPs\n- **Focus Areas**: CQP Manual, Hold / Witness Points, Concrete / Weld NDE, NCR Log (Cat A/B/C), RFI Aging <= 5d\n\n## Module Overview\nEnforce Inspection & Test Plans, hold/witness points, concrete/weld QA logs, submittals SLAs, and timely Non-Conformance closure.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | ISO 9001 Quality Management Systems & CSA/MEP Site Testing Best Practice | `PM22_Doc1_Standard_ISO_9001_Quality_Management_Systems_Rev.004.docx` | ISO 9001 QA/QC Standard |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Project Construction Quality Management Plan (CQP) & Testing Lab Scope | `PM22_Doc2_Deliverable_Project_Construction_Quality_Rev.004.docx` | Stage 5 Site CQP |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Trade Inspection & Test Plans (ITPs) with Hold / Witness Checkpoints | `PM22_Doc3_Template_Trade_Inspection_Test_Plans_ITPs_Rev.004.xlsx` | CSA / HV / MEP ITPs |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Non-Conformance Report (NCR), Field Observation & RFI Aging Dashboard | `PM22_Doc4_Audit_Non_Conformance_Report_NCR_Field_Rev.004.xlsx` | NCR / RFI Closure SLA |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Establish zero-defect construction discipline preventing hidden faults before Cx.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Define concrete cube crush tests, MV/HV cable hipots, and third-party weld NDE rules.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Require CxA/RE physical sign-off before burying conduits, slabs, or pipework.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Close overdue RFIs (<5 days) and open NCRs before they block handover certificates.\n",
