      "id": "PM-23",
      "title": "Multi-Disciplinary MEP / CSA Interface & Clash Coordination",
      "desc": "Resolve slab penetrations, busway/piping corridors, hot/cold aisle containment tolerances, and trade handoffs between CSA and MEP.",
      "tags": [
        "Interfaces",
        "BIM Clash",
        "MEP/CSA"
      ],
      "folder": "Phase_4_Execution_Controls_Risk_RIBA_5\\PM-23_MEP_CSA_Interface_BIM_Clash",
      "keyFacts": [
        "Tolerance: Zero Hard Clashes in Federated BIM LOD 400 prior to pour/build",
        "Critical Interfaces: Slabs -> HV Busway Risers -> Builders-Work Penetrations",
        "Cleanroom Transition: Data Halls 1-5 positive-pressure cleanroom gate (M5595)",
        "Static Floor: 800mm raised access floor + ESD grounding walkdown",
        "Coordination Cadence: Weekly Navisworks / ACC clash sign-off"
      ],
      "readme": "# PM-23: Multi-Disciplinary MEP / CSA Interface & Clash Coordination\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 4: Execution, Controls, Risk & Change (RIBA 5)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 4-5`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `M4350 -> M5595`\n- **WBS Scope**: `WBS 4.0-5.5`\n- **Governing Standards**: BS EN ISO 19650-2 Coordination, Navisworks / ACC BIM Clash Control\n- **Focus Areas**: 0 Clash Sign-Off, Slabs / Busway Risers, Builders-Work, White-Space Cleanroom, ESD Floor Walkdown\n\n## Module Overview\nResolve slab penetrations, busway/piping corridors, hot/cold aisle containment tolerances, and trade handoffs between CSA and MEP.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | BS EN ISO 19650-2 Spatial Coordination & Federated BIM Clash Standard | `PM23_Doc1_Standard_BS_EN_ISO_19650_2_Spatial_Rev.004.docx` | ISO 19650-2 Coordination |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Cross-Discipline Interface Responsibility & Sequence Plan (Slabs, Busways) | `PM23_Doc2_Deliverable_Cross_Discipline_Interface_Rev.004.docx` | CSA -> MEP -> BMS/EPMS |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Weekly Navisworks / ACC BIM Clash Resolution & Builders-Work Sign-Off | `PM23_Doc3_Template_Weekly_Navisworks_ACC_BIM_Clash_Rev.004.xlsx` | BIM Clash Matrix |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Data Hall White-Space Readiness Walkdown Checklist (Floor, ESD, Cleanliness) | `PM23_Doc4_Audit_Data_Hall_White_Space_Readiness_Rev.004.xlsx` | White-Space Sign-Off |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Catch clearance clashes digitally in LOD 350 models before pouring concrete slabs.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Sequence overhead containment, sprinkler racks, busbar aisles, and hot-aisle plenums.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Drive weekly clash counts down to zero per zone prior to IFC construction drawings.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Verify raised floor pedestals, airtight containment, and ISO cleanroom standards pre-rack.\n",
