      "desc": "Publish weekly/monthly control packs, 3-week/6-week constraint-free lookaheads, and crisp decision memos for executive sponsors.",
      "tags": [
        "Reporting",
        "Lookahead",
        "Governance"
      ],
      "folder": "Phase_4_Execution_Controls_Risk_RIBA_5\\PM-24_SteerCo_Reporting_Lookahead_PPC",
      "keyFacts": [
        "Lean Tool: Last Planner System (LPS) - 6-Week Lookahead + Weekly Work Plan",
        "Target Metric: Percent Plan Complete (PPC) >= 80% weekly reliability",
        "Constraint Removal: Design, Materials, Permits, Predecessor, Crew, Space, Safety",
        "Governance Pack: Monthly 1-Page Executive RAG, EVM, Cash & Risk Summary",
        "Escalation: Actionable decision paper 5 business days before SteerCo"
      ],
      "readme": "# PM-24: Executive Steering Reporting, Lookahead & Escalation\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 4: Execution, Controls, Risk & Change (RIBA 5)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 5`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `Weekly / Monthly Cadence`\n- **WBS Scope**: `All WBS`\n- **Governing Standards**: Last Planner System (LPS), Enterprise PMO SteerCo Reporting\n- **Focus Areas**: Weekly Lookahead, PPC >= 80%, Monthly SteerCo Pack, HSE / EVM / Cash, 1-Page RAG Escalation\n\n## Module Overview\nPublish weekly/monthly control packs, 3-week/6-week constraint-free lookaheads, and crisp decision memos for executive sponsors.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | Last Planner System (LPS) Pull Planning & Enterprise PMO Reporting Std | `PM24_Doc1_Standard_Last_Planner_System_LPS_Pull_Rev.004.docx` | Last Planner System |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Monthly Executive Steering Committee Pack (HSE, EVM, Cash, Top Risks) | `PM24_Doc2_Deliverable_Monthly_Executive_Steering_Rev.004.docx` | Monthly SteerCo Pack |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Rolling 6-Week Constraint-Free Lookahead & Percent Plan Complete (PPC) Log | `PM24_Doc3_Template_Rolling_6_Week_Constraint_Free_Rev.004.xlsx` | Weekly Site Lookahead |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | One-Page Executive Decision Memo & Red-Amber-Green (RAG) Recovery Brief | `PM24_Doc4_Audit_One_Page_Executive_Decision_Memo_Rev.004.docx` | Executive Escalation Memo |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Combine top-down P6 CPM milestones with weekly field constraint-removal workflows.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Present board-level RAG status, S-curves, and urgent capital decisions clearly.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Unblock permits, RAMS, materials, and drawings two weeks ahead of field crews.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Isolate root causes, quantified options, and clear leadership asks on one page.\n",
